Next, they put 21 new oranges into the bin. So, I need to add those 21 to the remaining 15 oranges. That would be 15 plus 21. Let me calculate that. 15 plus 20 is 35, and then plus 1 more is 36. So, 15 + 21 equals 36. Therefore, after adding the new oranges, the total number of oranges in the bin should be 36.

