- Chocolate: $2 \text{ boxes} \times 4 \text{ pieces} = 8 \text{ pieces}$
- Caramel: $5 \text{ boxes} \times 4 \text{ pieces} = 20 \text{ pieces}$

Adding these gives:
$$
8 + 20 = 28 \text{ pieces}
$$

---

